<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>StockFlow</title>
  <meta name="description" content="StockFlow is a simple, powerful inventory management system to track stock, orders and suppliers in real time." />

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <style>
    /* ============ 1. RESET & TOKENS ============ */
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    :root {
      --primary:        #fe424d;
      --primary-dark:   #e0202c;
      --primary-light:  #fff1f2;
      --accent:         #ff8a5c;
      --text:           #0f172a;
      --muted:          #64748b;
      --bg:             #ffffff;
      --surface:        #f8fafc;
      --border:         #e2e8f0;
      --radius:         12px;
      --shadow-sm:      0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, .06);
      --shadow-md:      0 4px 14px rgba(15, 23, 42, .08);
      --shadow-lg:      0 24px 50px rgba(15, 23, 42, .14);
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }
    ul { list-style: none; }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1180px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    /* ============ 2. BUTTONS ============ */
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: .925rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      white-space: nowrap;
      transition: all .2s ease;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(254, 66, 77, .28);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: var(--primary-dark);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(254, 66, 77, .35);
    }

    .btn-ghost { color: var(--text); }
    .btn-ghost:hover { background: var(--primary-light); color: var(--primary); }

    .btn-outline {
      background: #fff;
      border-color: var(--border);
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .btn-outline:hover {
      border-color: var(--primary);
      color: var(--primary);
      background: var(--primary-light);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .btn-lg { padding: 15px 30px; font-size: 1rem; border-radius: 12px; }

    /* ============ 3. NAVBAR ============ */
    .navbar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .nav-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      height: 72px;
    }

    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -.02em;
    }

    .logo-mark {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 11px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 19px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(254, 66, 77, .32);
    }

    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 34px; }

    .nav-links a {
      font-size: .925rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--muted);
      transition: color .2s;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--primary); }

    .nav-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }

    /* ============ 4. HERO ============ */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 84px 0 104px;
    }

    /* soft decorative glows */
    .hero::before,
    .hero::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      border-radius: 50%;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }
    .hero::before {
      top: -220px; right: -160px;
      width: 620px; height: 620px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(254, 66, 77, .14), transparent 68%);
    }
    .hero::after {
      bottom: -260px; left: -200px;
      width: 560px; height: 560px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 138, 92, .13), transparent 68%);
    }

    .hero-grid {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 64px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 6px 15px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--primary-light);
      border: 1px solid #ffd9dc;
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: .78rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: .01em;
    }
    .badge .pulse {
      width: 7px; height: 7px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #22c55e;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(34, 197, 94, .6);
      animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }
    @keyframes pulse {
      70%  { box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0); }
      100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(34, 197, 94, 0); }
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
      line-height: 1.08;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -.035em;
    }

    .gradient-text {
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .hero-sub {
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 22px 0 34px;
      font-size: 1.07rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .hero-buttons {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    /* stats row */
    .hero-stats {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 44px;
      margin-top: 52px;
      padding-top: 32px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .stat strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.55rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -.02em;
    }
    .stat span {
      font-size: .82rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* ============ 5. DASHBOARD MOCKUP ============ */
    .mockup {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 18px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
      overflow: hidden;
      animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes float {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
      50%      { transform: translateY(-14px); }
    }

    .mock-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      background: var(--surface);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; }
    .dot.red    { background: #ff5f57; }
    .dot.yellow { background: #febc2e; }
    .dot.green  { background: #28c840; }
    .mock-bar-title {
      margin-left: auto;
      font-size: .72rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: .04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .mock-body { padding: 22px; }

    .mock-cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }
    .mock-card {
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: var(--surface);
    }
    .mock-card small {
      display: block;
      font-size: .7rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .05em;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .mock-card b {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -.02em;
    }
    .trend { font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 999px; margin-left: 6px; vertical-align: 3px; }
    .trend.up   { color: #15803d; background: #dcfce7; }
    .trend.down { color: #b45309; background: #fef3c7; }

    .mock-chart-label {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: .74rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .mock-chart {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 9px;
      height: 118px;
    }
    .bar {
      flex: 1;
      border-radius: 7px 7px 3px 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--primary), #ff8a8f);
      opacity: .9;
      animation: grow .9s cubic-bezier(.16, 1, .3, 1) backwards;
    }
    .bar:nth-child(odd) { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--accent), #ffc4a3); }
    @keyframes grow { from { height: 0 !important; opacity: 0; } }

    /* ============ 6. FEATURES ============ */
    .features {
      padding: 92px 0;
      background: var(--surface);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .section-head { text-align: center; max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto 56px; }
    .section-head h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.4vw, 2.4rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -.03em;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .section-head p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.02rem; }

    .feature-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .feature-card {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 30px 26px;
      transition: all .25s ease;
    }
    .feature-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      border-color: #ffc9ce;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }

    .feature-icon {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 13px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      background: var(--primary-light);
    }
    .feature-card:nth-child(2) .feature-icon { background: #fff4ee; }
    .feature-card:nth-child(3) .feature-icon { background: #fef3c7; }
    .feature-card:nth-child(4) .feature-icon { background: #dcfce7; }

    .feature-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      letter-spacing: -.01em;
    }
    .feature-card p { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--muted); }

    /* ============ 7. CTA STRIP ============ */
    .cta {
      padding: 88px 0;
    }
    .cta-box {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 60px 32px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fe424d, #ff5c52 45%, #ff8a5c);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(254, 66, 77, .32);
    }
    .cta-box h2 {
      color: #fff;
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.4vw, 2.2rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -.03em;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .cta-box p {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .9);
      max-width: 480px;
      margin: 0 auto 30px;
    }
    .cta-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; justify-content: center; }
    .btn-white {
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--primary);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, .16);
    }
    .btn-white:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, .22); }
    .btn-ghost-white {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .12);
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .5);
      color: #fff;
    }
    .btn-ghost-white:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .22); transform: translateY(-2px); }

    /* ============ 8. FOOTER ============ */
    .footer {
      padding: 34px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: .875rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .footer-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--primary); }

    /* ============ 9. RESPONSIVE ============ */
    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 56px; }
      .hero-sub  { max-width: 100%; }
      .nav-links { display: none; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .hero { padding: 56px 0 72px; }
      .hero-stats { gap: 28px; }
      .stat strong { font-size: 1.3rem; }
      .hero-buttons .btn { flex: 1 1 auto; }
      .mock-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .cta-box { padding: 44px 22px; }
      .nav-actions .btn-ghost { display: none; } /* keep only Sign Up on tiny screens */
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- ============ NAVBAR ============ -->
  <header class="navbar">
    <div class="container nav-inner">
      <a href="" class="logo">
        <span class="logo-mark">📦</span>
        <span>StockFlow</span>
      </a>

      <nav>
        <ul class="nav-links">
          <li><a href="#features">Features</a></li>
          <li><a href="#how">How it works</a></li>
          <li><a href="#pricing">Pricing</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <div class="nav-actions">
        <% if(currUser) {%>
          <a href="/listings"  class="btn btn-ghost">Continue</a>
          <a href="/logout"  class="btn btn-ghost">Log Out</a>
          <%}%>
          <% if(!currUser) {%>
            <a href="/login"  class="btn btn-ghost">Login</a>
            <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-primary">Sign Up</a>
          <%}%>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">

        <!-- Left: copy -->
        <div class="hero-text">
          <span class="badge">
            <span class="pulse"></span> Trusted by 2,000+ businesses
          </span>

          <h1>
            Manage your <span class="gradient-text">inventory</span><br />
            without the chaos.
          </h1>

          <p class="hero-sub">
            Track stock levels, monitor orders, and get low-stock alerts in real time —
            all from one simple dashboard built for growing businesses.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-buttons">
            <% if(currUser) {%>
              <a href="/listings" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Continue →</a>
              <a href="/logout"  class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Log Out</a>
              <%}%>
            <% if(!currUser) {%>
              <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get Started Free →</a>
              <a href="/login"  class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Login to Account</a>
              <%}%>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-stats">
            <div class="stat"><strong>1.2M+</strong><span>Items tracked</span></div>
            <div class="stat"><strong>99.9%</strong><span>Uptime</span></div>
            <div class="stat"><strong>4.9★</strong><span>User rating</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: dashboard mockup -->
        <div class="hero-visual">
          <div class="mockup">
            <div class="mock-bar">
              <span class="dot red"></span>
              <span class="dot yellow"></span>
              <span class="dot green"></span>
              <span class="mock-bar-title">Inventory Dashboard</span>
            </div>

            <div class="mock-body">
              <div class="mock-cards">
                <div class="mock-card">
                  <small>Total Items</small>
                  <b>1,248</b><span class="trend up">+12%</span>
                </div>
                <div class="mock-card">
                  <small>Low Stock</small>
                  <b>23</b><span class="trend down">+5</span>
                </div>
                <div class="mock-card">
                  <small>Orders Today</small>
                  <b>86</b><span class="trend up">+8%</span>
                </div>
                <div class="mock-card">
                  <small>Stock Value</small>
                  <b>$48.2K</b>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="mock-chart-label">
                <span>Weekly Movement</span>
                <span>Last 7 days</span>
              </div>

              <div class="mock-chart">
                <div class="bar" style="height: 45%; animation-delay: .05s"></div>
                <div class="bar" style="height: 70%; animation-delay: .10s"></div>
                <div class="bar" style="height: 38%; animation-delay: .15s"></div>
                <div class="bar" style="height: 88%; animation-delay: .20s"></div>
                <div class="bar" style="height: 58%; animation-delay: .25s"></div>
                <div class="bar" style="height: 96%; animation-delay: .30s"></div>
                <div class="bar" style="height: 66%; animation-delay: .35s"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ FEATURES ============ -->
    <section class="features" id="features">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Everything you need to stay stocked</h2>
          <p>Powerful tools that keep your warehouse, orders, and reports perfectly in sync.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-grid">
          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
            <h3>Real-Time Stock Tracking</h3>
            <p>See exactly what's in stock, what's reserved, and what's running out — updated instantly.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">🔔</div>
            <h3>Low-Stock Alerts</h3>
            <p>Get automatic notifications before you run out, so you never miss a sale.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">🧾</div>
            <h3>Orders & Suppliers</h3>
            <p>Create purchase orders, manage suppliers, and track deliveries in one place.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">📈</div>
            <h3>Reports & Analytics</h3>
            <p>Export clean reports on sales, stock movement, and profit — anytime you need.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ CTA ============ -->
    <section class="cta" id="pricing">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-box">
          <h2>Ready to take control of your inventory?</h2>
          <p>Create your free account in under a minute. No credit card required.</p>

          <div class="cta-actions">
            <% if(currUser) {%>
            <a href="/listings" class="btn btn-white btn-lg">Continue</a>
            <a href="logout"  class="btn btn-ghost-white btn-lg">Log Out</a>
            <%}%>
            <% if(!currUser) {%>
            <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-white btn-lg">Create Free Account</a>
            <a href="/login"  class="btn btn-ghost-white btn-lg">I already have an account</a>
            <%}%>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <!-- ============ FOOTER ============ -->
  <footer class="footer" id="contact">
    <div class="container footer-inner">
      <span>© <span id="year"></span> StockFlow. All rights reserved.</span>

      <nav class="footer-links">
        <a href="#features">Features</a>
        <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
        <a href="#">Privacy</a>
        <a href="#">Support</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Auto-update the footer year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>

</body>
</html>